    "brandDefault": "When the accent is the brand default (also when the customer never changed it: empty or the production default #3B82F6), use the brand default accent AND the hand-tuned `--hero` gradient from `brandOverrides`. With any other accent use the formula in `tokens[\"--hero\"]`."
  },
